.THS Followup 5L News.SH NAME$N - a file to describe default newgroups to followup-to to a specificother newsgroup..SH DESCRIPTION.ti +3If an article is posted to a newsgroup where an answer should be placedin a different newsgroup the mechanism of a.B Followup-To:line in the header can be used. If no such line is given then this fileis examined to find the proper destination newgroup..SH FORMAT.ti +3The format of the file is.ce<source-ng>     <destination-ng>{,<destination-ng>}and describes the mapping from the source newsgroup to a destiantionnewgroup (or a list of them.).SH EXAMPLE.raw 4##    Replies to postings in sub.jokes should#    go to sub.jokes.dsub.jokes      sub.jokes.d.noraw